# Freally OS — the house .gitignore (from Freally Flipcopy's, 2026-11-17).
#
# ⛔ The repository is PUBLIC (owner, 2026-11-17: the code is Apache-2.0). The
# planning documents are NOT: the roadmap, the PRD, the vision, the go-to-market
# plan, the build-prompts guide, vision.json, Live-To-Do*.md, the handoff,
# research and anything under private/ stay in the working tree only.
# ⛔ Globs, not filenames: a sibling doc whose name an exact path does not match
# would sit untracked but NOT ignored, one `git add -A` from public.

# ── The docs site: its own private repository (the fleet's way) ──────────
# Built from the fleet site kit; published by the fleet's publish step from
# what that repository has pushed. Never part of this repository.
/site/

# ── Build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
**/target/
node_modules/
*.log

# ── Secrets — NEVER publish ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# The dev, staging and release signing keys live outside the repo
# (~/.freally-keys/ in WSL; the release key on its own USB drives). A key
# copied in here by accident is still never one commit from anywhere.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.seed
.freally-keys/
.env
.env.*

# ── The planning documents (PLAID) — NEVER publish ────────────────────────
/vision.json
/docs/prd.md
/docs/product-vision.md
/docs/gtm.md
/docs/ffs-format.md
/docs/research/
/private/
*[Rr]oadmap*
*ROADMAP*
*[Bb]uild-[Pp]rompts-[Gg]uide*
*BUILD-PROMPTS-GUIDE*
*[Bb]uild-*[Pp]rompts*
*[Hh]andoff*
*HANDOFF*
# Not the private handoff: the bootloader's own source (the patterns above
# match it on a case-blind filesystem, which kept it out of the repo).
!boot/src/handoff.rs
*[Ff]eature-[Rr]oadmap*
*[Cc]ompetition-[Gg]uide*
*PROGRESS*
Rolling-Session.md
# The owner's by-hand checks and the v1.0.0 release gate
/Live-To-Do*.md
Live-To-Do*.md
# The agents' standing orders (as in Freally Flipcopy)
/CLAUDE.md

# ── Machine-local ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.agents/
/vms/
*.qcow2
*.fd
